WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
Career Builder — an AI cockpit for the whole job search.

00:03.500 --> 00:05.600
One workspace for the whole search.

00:05.700 --> 00:08.900
Paste a job. Everything after that is automatic.

00:09.000 --> 00:10.200
Bring your own model — your key, your provider.

00:10.300 --> 00:13.000
NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Ultra 550B, from OpenRouter's own catalogue.

00:13.100 --> 00:15.000
Web search for grounding. A live scraper for real postings.

00:15.000 --> 00:18.300
Paste the job description, and your CV.

00:18.400 --> 00:20.900
A real evaluation streams in — live, section by section.

00:21.000 --> 00:23.700
A to G: fit, CV match, level and strategy, compensation.

00:23.800 --> 00:26.500
A customisation plan, an interview plan, and posting legitimacy — grounded in a live web search.

00:26.600 --> 00:28.100
All seven sections, finished and saved to your account.

00:28.200 --> 00:30.500
Nothing here is canned — it is the model's own output, streamed.

00:30.600 --> 00:32.900
Saved, applied, interviewing — one board.

00:33.000 --> 00:36.500
Drag a card and the stage updates everywhere it is tracked.

00:36.600 --> 00:38.800
The whole search, measured: average fit across every evaluation.

00:38.900 --> 00:41.000
Funnel, score distribution, and the archetype mix.

00:41.100 --> 00:43.000
Every run is kept, so the picture sharpens as you go.

00:43.100 --> 00:45.600
Discover starts from one role and one place.

00:45.700 --> 00:49.500
It expands the search into adjacent roles and specialisms.

00:49.600 --> 00:52.000
Career Builder.

00:52.000 --> 00:54.500
career-builder-five.vercel.app — source on GitHub.
